  "reason": "The current best (config_001, acc=0.725) uses scvi_n200 + multiprofile + transformer + weighted + imagenet_vit_l. The strongest pattern is that transformer aggregation and scvi_n200 are consistently the best choices. The only untested scvi_n200 + multiprofile + transformer combination is config_050 (resnet50, transformer, concat). This tests whether the concat fusion (which outperformed weighted under avgpool in config_031 vs 033) might synergize differently with resnet50 under transformer aggregation, potentially closing the small gap to 0.725. It also clarifies whether resnet50's higher F1 (0.695 in config_040) reflects a genuinely competitive classifier that could be further improved. Expected cost is moderate-to-high (~5.5–6.5 GPU hours, comparable to config_040's 6.22) due to resnet50 + transformer processing. With only one experiment remaining after this, the result will directly inform whether the final experiment should exploit a near-best configuration or accept config_001 as the winner."
}

